* <SIGNATURE>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* | Instance Public Method /RB1M/CL_SD_RFID_DATA->/RB1M/IF_SD_RFID_DATA~CALL_REST_API_RESPONSE
* +-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
* | [--->] IS_INTERNAL_REQ_DATA           TYPE        /RB1M/SD_INT_REQ(optional)
* | [--->] IS_EXTERNAL_REQ_DATA           TYPE        /RB1M/SD_EXT_REQ(optional)
